1
00:00:00,061 --> 00:00:03,851
(Sheldon:)Bow, General Zod trapped
in the Phantom Zone...

2
00:00:05,107 --> 00:00:06,737
..."bow-zone."

3
00:00:06,901 --> 00:00:10,781
Pear, tickle, "pear-tickle."

4
00:00:13,282 --> 00:00:17,032
"Higgs boson particle."
How could you not get that?

5
00:00:17,203 --> 00:00:20,543
(Leonard:)He's right, Penny. It's all there.

6
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:24,250
(Penny:)Look, Sheldon, sweetie,
I know you're feeling insecure...

7
00:00:24,418 --> 00:00:27,628
-...but we've really gotta go to sleep.
-All right.

8
00:00:27,797 --> 00:00:30,427
(Sheldon:)I'll take the first watch
and wake you at 0400.

9
00:00:30,633 --> 00:00:33,473
(Leonard:)-Great. Good night.
-Wait, wait. What's 0400?

10
00:00:33,636 --> 00:00:35,846
LEONARD: Four a.m.
-That's, like, in 45 minutes.

11
00:00:36,013 --> 00:00:38,553
(Leonard:)Just keep walking.

12
00:00:56,701 --> 00:01:00,041
WOMAN [ON VIDEO]: It's quiet out there.
MAN: Maybe a little too quiet.

